# Claude IDE local settings — local-only file kept untracked
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/launch.json
.claude/skills/*
# ...except the SkySlope form-compliance skill — tracked so it survives clones + is visible to Cursor (it is the audit-defensible compliance pipeline, not a throwaway local skill)
!.claude/skills/skyslope-form-compliance/
# ...and the growth-loop orchestrator skill — Loop 1 of the canon topology (docs/DEVELOPMENT_PROCESS.md §Loop topology)
!.claude/skills/growth-loop/
# ...and the local-seo loop skill — the GBP / map-pack / citations layer that complements growth-loop
!.claude/skills/local-seo/
# ...and the creative-brain — the permanent compounding creative knowledge system (6 research volumes + LESSONS ledger); tracked so it survives clones and compounds across sessions
!.claude/skills/creative-brain/
# ...and the four engineering-practice skills adapted from Matt Pocock's course-video-manager (2026-07-11) — tracked so they survive clones + are visible to Cursor
!.claude/skills/domain-context/
!.claude/skills/tdd/
!.claude/skills/optimize-data-loading/
!.claude/skills/document-external-api/
.claude/worktrees
.claude/cache
.claude/projects
